WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.040
In 1279, the Song and Yuan armies fought their final great sea battle near Yamen.

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:15.350
The sea wind stirred the banners, and the two armies' war drums sounded from far away.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:21.964
The Yuan warships were many and large, surrounding the Song fleet completely.

00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:28.914
The Song army fought desperately; shouts filled the sea and the battle was fierce.

00:00:29.264 --> 00:00:36.128
The Song army was defeated, and Lu Xiufu carried the young child emperor on his back and leapt into the sea.

00:00:36.478 --> 00:00:42.166
Only the quiet waves remained at the shore, gently washing the rocks.

00:00:42.516 --> 00:00:50.172
The Southern Song regime fell, and the Yuan completed its conquest of the main southern regions.

00:00:50.522 --> 00:00:58.490
The sun set, the sea grew calm again, and an era came to an end.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:03.136
Seagulls flew over the sea, as if telling this story of the past.

